{"id":"01d522a0b0df3738","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation.md","title":"Lachlan 阶段记号与有界 oracle 计算","display":"df-oracle-stage-evaluation — Lachlan 阶段记号与有界 oracle 计算","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","aliases":["20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation"],"display":"df-oracle-stage-evaluation — Lachlan 阶段记号与有界 oracle 计算","chapter":"3","section":"3.3.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 3.3.10","source_printed_pages":[57],"source_pdf_pages":[93],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-use]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-stage-evaluation — Lachlan 阶段记号与有界 oracle 计算"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.3.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.3.10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,e,x,z,y\\in\\omega\">\\(s,e,x,z,y\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_s)_{s\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\">\\((A_s)_{s\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x_s)_{s\\in\\omega}\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\((x_s)_{s\\in\\omega}\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> 是固定的阶段环境参数；常量输入取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_s=x\">\\(x_s=x\\)</span>。本记号不额外假设这些序列收敛或可计算。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hist}\">\\(\\operatorname{Hist}\\)</span> 的历史 c 含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|c|-1\">\\(|c|-1\\)</span> 次转移；有界 oracle 模拟的计算性相对于实际所用 oracle 解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle-stage-evaluation}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{B}(z)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ne,z,y&lt;s\\land\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\exists u\\in\\omega\\\n[\\operatorname{Hist}(e,B,z,y,c)\\land |c|-1&lt;s\n\\land u_e^B(z)\\downarrow=u\\land u&lt;s],\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)[s]\\simeq\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(x_s),\\\\\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\sigma}(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ne,x,y&lt;s\\land\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\exists u\\in\\omega\\\n[\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A_\\sigma,x,y,c)\\land |c|-1&lt;s\n\\land\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c)\\subseteq|\\sigma|\\\\\n\\land u_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=u\\land u&lt;s],\\\\\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{X}(x)\\simeq\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle-stage-evaluation}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{B}(z)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ne,z,y&lt;s\\land\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\exists u\\in\\omega\\\n[\\operatorname{Hist}(e,B,z,y,c)\\land |c|-1&lt;s\n\\land u_e^B(z)\\downarrow=u\\land u&lt;s],\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)[s]\\simeq\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(x_s),\\\\\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\sigma}(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ne,x,y&lt;s\\land\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\exists u\\in\\omega\\\n[\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A_\\sigma,x,y,c)\\land |c|-1&lt;s\n\\land\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c)\\subseteq|\\sigma|\\\\\n\\land u_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=u\\land u&lt;s],\\\\\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{X}(x)\\simeq\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有 use 比较都先通过停止图绑定自然数 u，不再把部分函数值作为无条件可用的算术项。保留 e、输入、输出、转移次数及 use 全部严格小于 s 的原边界。</p>\n<p>方括号阶段记号依赖已声明的阶段序列；它不自动声称早期值保持，也不把任意 oracle 的有界计算声称为普通可判定关系。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.3.10；印刷页 57；PDF 第 93 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-use]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,e,x,z,y\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"(A_s)_{s\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"(x_s)_{s\\in\\omega}\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x_s=x","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hist}","display":false},{"tex":"|c|-1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle-stage-evaluation}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{B}(z)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ne,z,y<s\\land\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{<\\omega}\\ \\exists u\\in\\omega\\\n[\\operatorname{Hist}(e,B,z,y,c)\\land |c|-1<s\n\\land u_e^B(z)\\downarrow=u\\land u<s],\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)[s]\\simeq\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(x_s),\\\\\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\sigma}(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ne,x,y<s\\land\\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{<\\omega}\\ \\exists u\\in\\omega\\\n[\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A_\\sigma,x,y,c)\\land |c|-1<s\n\\land\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c)\\subseteq|\\sigma|\\\\\n\\land u_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=u\\land u<s],\\\\\n\\Phi_{e,s}^{X}(x)\\simeq\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":2298,"backlinks":[{"id":"2e0d85a730fd3a26","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]。"},{"id":"94da30522fe93e7f","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depe